 ${misc:Depends}
Suggests:
 seznamds,
 multiflexi-cli,
 abraflexi-client-config
Description: Synchronize Czech ISDS data messages to AbraFlexi Events
 Fetches received Czech ISDS (Informační systém datových schránek / Data
 Box) messages and creates a corresponding Event (evidence "udalost") in
 AbraFlexi for each new message, attaching the message's documents and
 optionally linking it to a matching Adresar record found by the sender's
 IČO. Already synced messages are skipped on subsequent runs, and messages
 can optionally be marked as downloaded in ISDS once synced.

Package: multiflexi-abraflexi-isds
Architecture: all
Depends:
 abraflexi-isds,
 multiflexi-cli,
 ${misc:Depends}
Recommends:
 multiflexi-datovka
Description: MultiFlexi configuration of AbraFlexi ISDS sync
 Set up the ISDS-to-AbraFlexi Events synchronizer in MultiFlexi.
 Data Box login is provided by a "Datovka" credential (see the
 multiflexi-datovka package) assigned to the RunTemplate.
